=00_Af9FcyhSIhtm71eXSNO2iW2TAltNrTFd_knLlwDsDIOERw&oe=6A3009C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ef4ZOYsMgAcQ7kNvwGu-Gq2&_nc_oc=AdqpwYuG-Iykn1AyDc-tZ7JakOjk9-3p52n9-NYqutkEiquBZIdEcTVhkIWcvcxD-ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Xx52uuqYbp0qjShHQ1WfDvlAE_NG88u40xIbE00OYjQ&oe=6A2FFF3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JQsLHjd2rpEQ7kNvwFl9AKU&_nc_oc=AdrLuED_tGbfy_-EU1Ktf2yilmr8uWDE11jOnK1g5hqWPTRaazH4-cfFVQ1tjJcbYGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6VnVgQJCpsCQiQy5qsqPVP00JVVDHYClB_wUm7ToBkg&oe=6A300E30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_descr